      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACKY LEGS (2) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when third (30.34) at this track. Must come into calculations. PEANUT KEEPING (7) has missed the frame the last couple but just a few runs back pushed the clock when winning over 520m at Wentworth Park, taking a Grade 5 in a strong 29.83. Has the ability and can find winning form again. MISTRESS MAYHEM (3) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 6 lengths into second (29.97) at this track in a Grade 5 over 520m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. IONA HUNTRIX (4) picked up an unexpected cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
